# __APP_NAME__

Run `cargo run` in this directory to start the Connect server at the address in `app.json`. In a second shell, use `node client.mjs` to read the public service setting. The response comes from the deployment configuration.

Edit the entity in `proto/app/setting.proto` and run `paydirt gen` to regenerate the standard service contract and Rust bindings. The server wiring in `src/main.rs` and handlers in `src/core.rs` belong to this app. Use `paydirt gen --check` in CI.
